WEBVTT

00:06:28.375 --> 00:06:30.458
a get out of jail free card.

00:06:32.542 --> 00:06:36.518
The simple truth is that race is a system.

00:06:36.542 --> 00:06:39.851
It's like oxygen, like an atmosphere.

00:06:39.875 --> 00:06:43.393
It flows everywhere in our society.

00:06:43.417 --> 00:06:47.309
It infects everybody it touches.

00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:50.167
It protects power and privilege.

00:06:51.625 --> 00:06:53.309
Whose?

00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:55.417
Well, look around you.

00:06:56.667 --> 00:06:58.934
So what is it like for people of color,

00:06:58.958 --> 00:07:00.434
people like me,